| Sole proprietor | Proprietor identity; trade-name registration; business licence; tax registration; operating evidence |
| General partnership | Partnership deed; current partner list; capital and profit-sharing schedules; partner mandate |
| Limited partnership | Partnership agreement; general-partner details; limited-partner records as applicable |
| LLP | LLP registration; agreement; member register; designated-member details |
