| Association, club, or society | Constitution; registration; officeholder list; meeting minutes; account resolution |
| Charity or nonprofit | Charity registration; governing instrument; trustees; funding and program evidence |
| Foundation | Charter; statutes or bylaws; founder, council, protector or equivalent role records |
